  "contentHtml": "<p>이번 자유 학기 활동으로는 재과만카페에 있는 수업 사례를 바탕으로 식물을 이용한 의상 디자인 활동을 진행해보았습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>코로나때문에 견학도 못가는 학생들이 그나마 학교 뒤 공원에서 돌아다니면서 식물 채칩하고 움직이는 활동을 하니 학생들이 너무 좋아하더라구요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e56d03d58ac37694a732680f0a2ab12cf2e767ab\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e56d03d58ac37694a732680f0a2ab12cf2e767ab\" data-orgin-width=\"514\" data-origin-height=\"823\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75620bac2a2e32c43131c1a5438848960af084de\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75620bac2a2e32c43131c1a5438848960af084de\" data-orgin-width=\"769\" data-origin-height=\"530\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7910a819998a774a321e7eff89203acd8e59b444\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7910a819998a774a321e7eff89203acd8e59b444\" data-orgin-width=\"806\" data-origin-height=\"525\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/daec1db2db647c6eb7b8d65fc1c77f674a0427a6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/daec1db2db647c6eb7b8d65fc1c77f674a0427a6\" data-orgin-width=\"629\" data-origin-height=\"776\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18dcb24067514d6d986f12ac5fed0d8149eaa1d0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"htt